to make gingerbread house kits the  factory starts with baking soda a  leavening ingredient a worker adds a  scoop of salt to the baking soda and  measures these ingredients by weight he  transfers the baking soda and salt to an  enormous mixer he measures the spices  cinnamon ginger nutmeg and allspice he  closes the mixer and the system pipes in  water molasses and sugar at the top of  the mixer he tosses in a big block of  vegetable shortening  the mixer creams all the ingredients and  blends in the flour producing a  putty-like dough  a spiraling mechanism now helps move the  dough onto a conveyor a roller flattens  the chunks so they won't fall off during  the steep climb at the top the conveyor  levels off and delivers the chunks of  dough to a machine known as a sheeter  because it rolls the pieces into a  seemingly endless sheet a large cookie  cutter swoops down propelled by  compressed air it punches out various  shapes producing gingerbread cookies  that will fit together to form a house  the cookie cutouts land on moving rubber  coated wires separators between the  wires knock off the excess gingerbread  dough to be captured and mixed into the  next batch  the cookies then leave the wire  conveyors and a mesh one takes them up  to a baking sheet belt the baking sheet  belt travels slowly through a long  convection oven exiting the oven the  baked gingerbread shapes transfer to a  spiral conveyor and after a 30 minute  ride the dough has cooled and firmed up  workers stack the pieces for one  gingerbread house onto a piece of  cardboard and they're ready to be  packaged with the rest of the kit  elsewhere in the factory they blend  together the icing ingredients for the  kits with the icing ready plastic  packaging moves towards hot jaws that  seal the bottoms a robot grabs a package  and opens the top and a fill nozzle  pumps the icing into it  another robot applies an applicator tip  and heat seals the plastic around it a  worker retrieves them and places them in  a box for transfer to the kit assembly  station  once packaged in a kit these gingerbread  houses are ready for quick builds
 

